  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRC needs to stop limiting people's models and start working on ways to improve performance. One ESSENTIAL thing, that could easily be added, is auto LOD generation. \nIt would be a simple system that generates LODs for avatars upon upload, reducing poly count by 10% on 100 units away and 25% on 500+(or something along those lines). That would help quest run the game better, without forcing creators to have to lower their poly count to absurdly low amounts.\nAnother useful thing would be allowing manual LOD on worlds(specifically, for objects). That would also help performance a ton.",
